WEBVTT

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:14.670
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:18.910
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:22.310
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.350
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.290
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.590
My ears hurt...!

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:41.890
What's that sound?!

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:50.210
The alarm...
My friend...has awakened!

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:00.550
What's this?!

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:02.690
Angel Gozen!

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.690
What? l kind of...

00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:05.560
Suddenly...

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:07.220
Chii-chin! Saa-chan!

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:10.360
What?!

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:13.760
lt's like...

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:17.760
Strength is draining... from my body...

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.670
This is his meal.

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:24.810
He doesn't bother eating flesh, which has poor absorption efficiency.

00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:30.210
He drains the life force and makes that into energy for himself!

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.680
This is bad, Kazuki!

00:01:32.090 --> 00:01:37.490
lf we don't do something quickly, everyone will be eaten alive!

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:39.430
l won't let that happen!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.960
lmpudent boy!
That line belongs to...

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:46.400
the improved Doctor Butterfly,
Master Butterfly!

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.400
There's no need for you to go along

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:54.170
with the order of events
Muto determined.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.170
lf you're going to go along with something,

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.580
could you make it my order?

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:01.840
The research you left was my catalyst.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.440
And this suit is totally the greatest.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.280
But l've no intention of behaving myself,

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.380
just because you think l need protection.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:13.960
Test with your life whether or not l need protection!

00:02:14.530 --> 00:02:15.790
Rebellion is settled.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.230
ln other words...your death is settled.

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:22.400
Oops, the special property of your Buso Renkin is figured out already.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:26.000
lt affects the nerve threads and throws off sense of direction.

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:28.710
You're no match for my Near-Death Happiness!

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:33.040
You fool! That's just the effect in a diffused state.

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.980
The effect in a concentrated state is much worse!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:41.020
Behold! The true power of my Buso Renkin!

00:02:41.320 --> 00:02:45.560
I'll grind you down and kill you from inside your mind.

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:48.460
I'll burn your body up before that!

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.290
No, no. That's impossible for you!

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:52.800
Do you know why?!

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.660
Do you see?

00:02:57.670 --> 00:03:00.400
That talk is from when we were both humans, right?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:03.640
Things are different now.
Totally different.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:05.610
My name is...

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.050
Papillon!

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:22.690
The "Third Existence" that exceeds both humans and homunculi...

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.630
l was convinced

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:28.640
the human-type homunculus was of the highest class.

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:32.200
But to think there is something beyond that.

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:33.830
l have decided.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.840
l will abandon this incomplete body

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.810
and fly to further heights!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.450
My ancestor.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.210
We may resemble each other, but we're very different.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.740
You just sneak about drawn by a radiant light...

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:52.750
You're an unsightly moth that can't fly high or far by yourself!

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.330
Don't stop, Kazuki!

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.030
l know, Tokiko!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.900
Getting up to the roof one minute, one second faster is top priority!

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:01.200
l know!

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.830
<i>l know! But...!</i>

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:06.830
Kazuki!

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.480
This is...!

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.310
Guys...

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:13.380
Kazuki!

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:15.680
Don't open it, Kazuki!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.340
l know how you feel!

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:19.290
But we have to move now!

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:20.520
Don't open it...!

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.120
<i>lf you open it,</i>

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.420
<i>not only your legs,</i> <i>but your heart will stop as well...!</i>

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:29.330
l'm sorry... l can't... just pass right by.

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:30.260
Kazuki!

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.500
<i>Who Are You?</i>

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:44.170
l thought l heard a voice. l knew it was you.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:45.650
Okakura!

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:47.080
You okay?

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:47.910
Yeah.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:49.250
What about everyone in the class?!

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.380
Yeah, they're okay...

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.080
Don't go in.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:03.290
As Daihama said... everyone's okay.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:05.260
Don't worry.

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:07.600
But...!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:11.500
lt's not necessary... for you to go inside.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:14.640
Don't go in...

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.200
But...

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.510
These kids you see,

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.070
they had a bit more of a frightening experience than the others,

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:22.950
so they've gotten that much woozier...

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:25.420
We were thinking of taking them to the health office.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.420
Really... lt's okay.

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:29.080
But!

00:05:32.030 --> 00:05:35.790
l'm saying we're okay!
Just get going!

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.700
There are still monsters left, right?

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:41.260
You're the only one who can defeat them, right?!

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.730
You're everyone's ally, right?!

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.740
Then for everyone's sake...

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:49.710
I'll fight!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.150
You know what you're doing...

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:59.550
Then get going, fight and win!

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.160
Tokiko...

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.060
l leave my big brother...to you...

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.930
Sometimes...

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.340
he pushes things too far, so.

00:06:16.940 --> 00:06:18.460
Yeah. l know...

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.840
Jeez, he's such a handful...

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:27.270
lt can't be helped...
That's Kazuki...

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.080
Then we'd better also...

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.510
Yeah, let's get these kids...

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.080
to the health...offi...

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:43.230
<i>Then get going...</i>

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.270
<i>fight and win!</i>

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:55.440
Kazuki?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.270
—We'll take a shortcut.
—What?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.720
You seem to be in quite a bit of pain...

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.150
my ancestor.

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:17.160
lf you'll tell me about the man in the flask,

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.770
l could protect you.

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:23.100
Heh, you sarcastic jerk.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:25.240
You're one to talk,

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.070
piercing through the center of my emblem mark...

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:32.180
Oh well. I'll tell you.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:34.740
Not as a relative,

00:07:34.820 --> 00:07:39.190
but as a fellow alchemist striving for further heights.

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:41.920
Victor.

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:45.920
He's a former Alchemist Warrior.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.760
One hundred years ago,

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:54.100
he turned into a third form exceeding both humans and homunculi...

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.200
was pursued by his comrades

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:59.300
and sought refuge here after a rough battle.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:05.040
ln exchange for sharing all his knowledge of Alchemy with me,

00:08:05.180 --> 00:08:11.710
l promised to restore him, no matter how long it took.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:16.920
lt seems you've gone senile, l've already heard that story.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:20.820
Don't rush an old man.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:28.160
After completing one hundred years of alchemist research...

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:34.470
l completed my original creation, the restoration flask.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.640
The formation of the LXE was also to protect him

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:40.710
from Alchemist Warriors...

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:41.750
And?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.310
Why was he pursued by his comrades?

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.850
l don't know.
Try asking him yourself.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.920
What's his purpose?

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:53.220
l don't know.
Only he can answer that.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.430
How do l become like him?

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.930
Figure it out yourself.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:01.500
You jerk, great-great-grandfather.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.970
That's no answer at all.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:10.370
Well, it can't be helped. l'm a moth just as you said.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:16.980
lt's presumptuous for the moth to attempt to touch the light.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:22.820
As an alchemist, as a friend fascinated by him...

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:28.060
it will do if l can restore him...

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:39.540
l'm satisfied to have been able to fly around the light like a moth.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:42.140
You couldn't become a butterfly

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.180
because you were satisfied with just that.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.540
Don't miss out, Papillon!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.010
Kazuki?!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:06.830
lf you wish to fly to further heights as a butterfly...

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:10.090
don't take your eyes off the battle

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:15.580
that is about to happen between him and that boy warrior!

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.870
lt seems during these one hundred years...

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.420
there were...actions...

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:28.120
l wasn't...aware of...

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.830
Energy...full blast.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.930
Pierce through!

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:55.170
Pierce through!

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.930
Good morning. Who are you?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.170
The Sunlight Heart hasn't pierced even one millimeter!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.260
Buso Renkin...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:18.360
An Alchemist Warrior, huh...?

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.180
How fragile.

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:25.840
Not enough training.

00:11:26.010 --> 00:11:26.910
Kazuki!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:39.220
<i>Pale blue glowing hair...</i>

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:41.890
<i>Copper skin that radiates heat...</i>

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:45.500
<i>A muscular giant nearly</i> <i>seven feet tall...</i>

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:46.930
<i>This is...!</i>

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:51.540
A third existence exceeding both humans and homunculi...

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.740
Good...morning...

00:11:58.410 --> 00:12:01.280
Good morning... Victor...

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.390
Good night, Butterfly...

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.760
Death is the fate of all those who practice Alchemy.

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.520
This is...Energy Drain!

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.660
Even though the flask was destroyed...

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.260
he's getting stronger and stronger!

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.570
No one will be able to hold out through this...!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:25.800
Stop!

00:12:35.220 --> 00:12:36.120
lmpossible.

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.990
This is the same as breathing for me.

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:43.850
lt is not my power, but my biology. l can't stop it.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:45.990
Then how can it be stopped?

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.890
lf you want to stop it...

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.330
then you must destroy me.

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:00.240
Are you going to fight me?

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.150
So you're going to fight...

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:12.550
Very well.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.080
Of course l have no intention of letting you live,

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.680
knowing that you're an Alchemist Warrior.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.260
I'll kill all Alchemist Warriors.

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.990
This is...hatred?

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:28.070
Everyone will die if l don't fight!

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:33.900
Energy, full blast! Full blast!
Full blast! Full blast!

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:37.030
Let's go!

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:40.110
Sunlight Crasher!

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.790
<i>Kazu...ki...</i>

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:56.420
Kazuki!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:03.900
Victor!

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:27.550
Kazuki.

00:14:28.360 --> 00:14:29.160
Let's go!

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:30.560
Yeah!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.300
Victor!

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:35.170
lf we don't beat him, everyone will...!

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:42.740
lt's futile.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.210
Tokiko!

00:14:57.590 --> 00:14:59.290
Victor!

00:15:04.530 --> 00:15:05.830
l told you it's futile.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.500
Kazuki!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.270
<i>ls power building up</i> <i>inside him again?</i>

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:18.580
Who are you?

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:23.110
Whoever you are,

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:25.590
you're not an opponent l can handle bare-handed, huh?

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:30.620
Then I'll also be using...
Buso Renkin!

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:34.860
<i>What's that?</i>

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.500
<i>l've never seen a black kakugane...</i>

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:46.100
Fatal Attraction!

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.210
<i>What...the heck...?</i>

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:53.410
Kazuki, don't!

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:56.150
This guy's an unknown existence to us!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.080
Let's stall for time until the Warrior Chief gets here.

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:01.710
No! No one, including you Tokiko, can hold that long!

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.380
l know he can be injured somehow!

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.820
We'll grind away at him little by little!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:21.870
<i>lt's your new life.</i>

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.200
He died in vain...

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:06.850
Darn it!

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:10.720
The closer you get to me,

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:12.660
the more intense the Energy Drain becomes.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:14.750
How unsightly.

00:17:15.530 --> 00:17:18.470
The warriors a hundred years ago were more valiant.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:21.260
For those who have become warriors,

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:24.330
death after a battle should be the inevitable resolution.

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.340
No!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:27.010
Kazuki isn't like that!

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:31.440
Kazuki used to be an ordinary high school student...

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:37.910
And...on that spring night two months ago,

00:17:39.820 --> 00:17:42.790
l dragged him into battle...

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:49.230
And in the end...

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:05.780
<i>Tokiko... Are you crying?</i>

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:09.410
<i>l have...to fight...</i>

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:13.150
And in the end, l let him die.

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:16.750
lf that's what you think,
I'll let you die with him.

00:18:20.090 --> 00:18:22.930
Living and dying alone is a tragic thing.

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:32.960
What?!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:43.480
<i>Kazuki's kakugane...is pulsing...!</i>

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:51.020
Kazuki...

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.260
I'll fight...

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.290
Kazuki?

00:18:57.530 --> 00:19:04.170
I'll fight... I'll fight...

00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:06.570
Darn it.

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.210
What's happening up there?

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:13.710
Butterfly's kakugane...

00:19:15.680 --> 00:19:19.310
Perfect. I'll use this one's healing power...

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:27.820
I'll fight...! I'll fight...!
I'll fight...!

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.520
—Kazuki...?
—I'll fight...

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:34.100
I'll fight...! I'll fight...!
I'll fight...!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:35.600
Fight!

00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.000
Kazuki?!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.850
You'll be the only one to die, Victor!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:57.790
l see. You're the same as me...

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:01.860
So you also traded your life for the black kakugane, huh?

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.060
<i>That spring night two months ago...</i>

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:10.660
<i>What did l do to Kazuki?</i>
<i>What have l done to him...?</i>

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:19.790
l will make up in anyway l can... for turning you into this.

00:20:20.230 --> 00:20:23.930
So please Kazuki, don't let your heart change.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:26.760
Next time, "An lntermediate Existence."

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.270
I'll splatter your guts out!

00:20:33.610 --> 00:20:36.340
Mahiro Seminar
Hi hi! This is Mahiro Muto!

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:40.510
l'm back to properly introduce another Buso Renkin!

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:44.250
For our fifth presentation we have the "Near-Death Happiness."

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.350
Yes, that's right,

00:20:45.420 --> 00:20:47.250
it's the Buso Renkin of that butterfly weirdo...

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:52.790
No, no, no, l mean Mr. Papillon?
Or better yet, Pappy!

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:56.360
His human name was Koshaku Chono.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:59.370
But now that he's become a humanoid homunculus,

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.700
the only person who can call him by that name is my big brother.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:08.450
Are those two enemies? Rivals?
Or... friends?

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:11.410
Hmm... l don't really get it,

00:21:11.480 --> 00:21:14.380
but it seems they have a very deep connection.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:19.420
Pappy was very sickly back when he was a human being,

00:21:19.490 --> 00:21:21.690
but after continuous research on the homunculi,

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.990
succeeded in becoming a humanoid homunculus himself.

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:28.790
Plus! He even attained the kakugane and can now use a Buso Renkin.

00:21:28.870 --> 00:21:33.300
And that's the Black Powder Buso Renkin,
Near-Death Happiness.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:36.070
See those butterfly wings made of a black powder

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.040
like substance growing on Pappy's back?

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.540
They're actually composed of gunpowder.

00:21:40.810 --> 00:21:44.680
He can fly by burning the tip of the wings!

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.450
How cool! l wanna fly too!

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:51.220
And! The special property of Near-Death Happiness

00:21:51.290 --> 00:21:57.090
allows Pappy to fire the black powder in any shape, and ignite it at will.

00:21:57.560 --> 00:22:00.760
The black powder can reach a radius of 50 meters (164ft).

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:04.700
But apparently he cannot explode it unless it's within visual range.

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:07.440
Hmm... l see...!

00:22:07.740 --> 00:22:10.540
Oh, and by the way, despite being able to take any shape,

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:14.700
the reason why Pappy uses the shape of a butterfly is because that's his taste.

00:22:14.780 --> 00:22:17.010
What a lovely weirdo, isn't he?

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:20.050
Okie dokies, tune in next time!

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:28.520
